# Krate browser support policy.
#
# Krate targets evergreen engines that implement ES2020. The compiler emits
# ES2020 for hydration chunks and workers; the client runtime bundle uses the
# same baseline. There is no ES5/legacy downleveling or differential serving.
#
# Baseline (ES2020): Chrome 87+, Edge 88+, Firefox 78+, Safari 14+.
# Update this file and docs/core-concepts/browser-support.md together when the
# baseline changes.
